    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lăbĕo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>amplif.</i>
			[labium], <i>one who has large lips, who is
				blubber-lipped</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">esse quosdam capitones, frontones, labeones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 3, 108</span></i>
			; cf.: labio, Ver. Flac. ap. <i><span class="en">Charis. 1,
				79</span></i>.</div>
